  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional decision. Seminar on the university course &quot;Sustainable water Management - Baltic University Programme (BUP)&quot;. BUP has since 1991 recieved support from BITS/Sida. This concerns a three-day seminar where swedish and international experts will participate in the field of environmental education.</narrative>
